  "notes": "DATA DEFECT (genuine, kept verbatim): the 2026-2027 UNA Undergraduate Catalog's AHS semester-by-semester plan (p. 205) is truncated mid-table — Year Three Spring (2nd Term) prints only 'AHS 303R Health Policy, Ethics and Legal Issues 6' and the page then continues with the Occupational Therapy Assistant program. The AHS requirements table (p. 204) lists AHS 304R Epidemiology and Population Health, AHS 305R Consumer Health (or KIN 408), and AHS 306R Research in Health, which presumably belonged in the missing rows, but the plan itself does not show them, so nothing is invented. Sequenced visible sum = 112; catalog prints Total Hours 120. Expect build.py to exclude on total mismatch; flagged honestly. Placeholder rows ('Remaining three hours of Area II Requirement', 'Remaining four hours of Natural Science requirement', 'Elective 3 hours') seeded as choice slots with empty code and the catalog's exact wording as title. AHS R-courses carry the catalog's superscript 3 footnote marker (definition not printed in the plan section). Source PDF verified by download 2026-10-01.",
